OL,5,G0230 Great Coastal Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FLiverpool to Blackpool: Michael
OL,7,     FPortillo journeys to Liverpool's
OL,8,     Fhistoric waterfront, where he
OL,9,     Fvisits the International Slavery
OL,10,     FMuseum, before heading north
OL,11,     Ftowards Blackpool.
OL,12,G0300 Great Coastal Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FMorecambe to Grange-over-Sands:
OL,14,     FMichael Portillo continues his
OL,15,     Fjourney across the vast and
OL,16,     Fbeautiful Morecambe Bay, where he
OL,17,     Fjoins one of the town's last
OL,18,     Fshrimpers.
