OL,5,G0505 Great Coastal Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FScarborough to Bridlington:
OL,7,     FMichael Portillo is in the North
OL,8,     FYorkshire seaside resort of
OL,9,     FScarborough to explore one of the
OL,10,     Fgreatest royal fortresses in
OL,11,     FEngland.
OL,12,G0530 Great Coastal Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FLee-on-the-Solent to Bosham:
OL,14,     FMichael Portillo explores Lee on
OL,15,     Fthe Solent in Hampshire, the
OL,16,     Fmaritime city of Portsmouth, and
OL,17,     FChichester's vast, natural
OL,18,     Fharbour.
